<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>PAUL KAGANDA</title><style>body{background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:system-ui;margin:0}header{background:#111;padding:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;position:sticky;top:0}header b span{color:#f5c518}.wa{background:#f5c518;color:#000;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}.about{text-align:center;padding:24px;border:2px solid #f5c518;border-radius:20px;margin:12px}.about img{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;border:4px solid #f5c518}.card{background:#121212;border:1px solid #222;border-radius:16px;padding:16px;margin:12px}.card h3{color:#f5c518}.title{padding:20px 16px;font-size:22px;font-weight:900}footer{text-align:center;padding:20px;color:#555}</style></head><body><header><b><span>PAUL</span> KAGANDA</b><a class="wa" href="https://wa.me/256709478798">WhatsApp</a></header><div class="about"><img src="paul.jpg"><h2>PAUL KAGANDA</h2><p>20 YEARS • KYOTERA POET</p><p>Kyotera Uganda - love in small things</p></div><div class="title">My Poems 🔥</div>
<div class="card"><h3>THE COFFEE WE SHARE</h3><p>I wake before the kettle sings your name</p></div><div class="card"><h3>HOW YOU FOLD MY SHIRTS</h3><p>You fold my shirts like you mean it</p></div><div class="card"><h3>YOUR KEYS ON MY TABLE</h3><p>Your keys land loud on my table</p></div><div class="card"><h3>GROCERY LIST LOVE</h3><p>We write list on back of bills</p></div><div class="card"><h3>WE COOK UGLY RICE</h3><p>We cook rice that sticks a bit</p></div><footer>© 2026 PAUL KAGANDA • Kyotera</footer></body></html>
